  "limits": "Panel cuts snap to a 32 by 32 grid, so every panel is an axis-aligned rectangle with no diagonal or rounded panels. One tile holds one subdivision, so a large wall repeats visibly; vary the seed between surfaces. Light strips are emissive colour, not light sources. Occlusion is a blurred-height estimate, not ray traced.",
